---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Pricing from '../components/Pricing.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Pricing - CloudDroid"
  description="Simple, transparent pricing for CloudDroid cloud Android workspaces. Monthly billing."
  jsonLd={{
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'Product',
    name: 'CloudDroid Developer',
    description: 'Cloud Android workspace for individual developers and small projects. 4 GB RAM, 32 GB storage, 1 concurrent instance.',
    brand: { '@type': 'Brand', name: 'CloudDroid' },
    offers: {
      '@type': 'Offer',
      price: '1499.00',
      priceCurrency: 'USD',
      billingIncrement: 'P1M',
      availability: 'https://schema.org/InStock',
      url: `${Astro.url.origin}/checkout/developer`,
    },
  }}
>
  <div class="bg-slate-light py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">Pricing</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate mb-8">Simple, transparent pricing. No hidden fees. Cancel anytime.</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate mt-3">Prices exclude applicable taxes and VAT. VAT will be calculated and displayed at checkout where required by law.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="pricing-section">
    <Pricing />
  </div>

  <div class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-8 text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 group">
          <summary class="text-sm font-semibold text-navy cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
            What Android versions are supported?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate">We support Android 10 through Android 14. Each instance runs a clean, isolated Android environment with full ADB access.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 group">
          <summary class="text-sm font-semibold text-navy cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
            How do I extend my access?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate">Access is granted per purchase. When your access period is about to end, simply purchase your plan again to extend it. Your existing account and data will be preserved.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 group">
          <summary class="text-sm font-semibold text-navy cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
            Do you offer a free trial?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate">We do not offer a free trial. However, we provide a 14-day money-back guarantee if you are not satisfied with the service.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 group">
          <summary class="text-sm font-semibold text-navy cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
            What payment methods do you accept?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate">We accept all major credit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express) via Dodo Payments. European customers can also pay via iDEAL, Bancontact, and other local methods through Mollie.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 group">
          <summary class="text-sm font-semibold text-navy cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
            Is my data isolated from other customers?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate">Yes. Each instance runs in a strictly containerized environment with zero cross-talk between customers. Data is encrypted at rest with AES-256.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 group">
          <summary class="text-sm font-semibold text-navy cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
            Do you offer custom enterprise plans?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate">Yes. Contact us at sales@clouddroid.eu for custom pricing, dedicated infrastructure, and SLA guarantees tailored to your organization.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy mb-8 text-center">Compare Plans</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-200">
              <th class="py-3 pr-4 font-semibold text-navy">Feature</th>
              <th class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-navy text-center">Developer</th>
              <th class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-navy text-center">Professional</th>
              <th class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-navy text-center">Team</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate">RAM</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-slate">4 GB</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-slate">8 GB</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-slate">16 GB</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate">Storage</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-slate">32 GB</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-slate">64 GB</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-slate">128 GB</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate">Concurrent Instances</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-slate">1</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-slate">4</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-slate">12</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate">ADB Access</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-accent">Included</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-accent">Included</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-accent">Included</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate">CI/CD Integrations</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-slate-400">—</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-accent">Included</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-accent">Included</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate">Support</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-slate">Email</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-slate">Priority</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-slate">24/7 Dedicated</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate">Uptime SLA</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-slate-400">—</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-slate-400">—</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-accent">99.9%</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="py-16 bg-slate-light">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">Need a Custom Solution?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate mb-8">Enterprise pricing, dedicated infrastructure, and custom SLA guarantees. Talk to our sales team.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-navy text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-navy-light transition-colors">
        Contact Sales
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>